        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Heat, at hot water tank, solar+gas, flat plate, multiple dwelling
Use of a solar system including the necessary auxiliary heating.;
Synonyms: MFD, Multiple family dwelling; 
UUID: 5ab70239-263e-30f0-acb8-65fbb970dddb
Delivery of heat with a solar system including the necessary auxiliary heating, maintenance and electricity use for operation.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Operation of a solar collector system in combination with a gas heating.
Time period: Time of simulation.
Production volume: Total solar heat delivered by flat plate collectors in 2001 was 37TJ.
Sampling: Simulation done by SPF Rapperswil with Polysun 3.3 computer programme. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5ab70239-263e-30f0-acb8-65fbb970dddb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
